        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Metro Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia Metro Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Handleset has an urban modern feel that will add an industrial chic dimension to your home as your front door lock. The Omnia Metro Front Door Lock features a 1 inch high security stainless steel deadbolt and stainless latch. It fits a standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door prep with 5-1/2 inch Center to Center spacing. This single cylinder handleset is also Panic Proof (turning the inside door lever will unlock the deadbolt for easy quick emergency exits).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Panic Proof:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever on the inside and a thumbpiece on the outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/omnia-metro-dummy-stainless-steel-handleset\"><b>Dummy Metro Handleset</b></a> for the inactive door on a double door pair.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Metro Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Panic Proof</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder (Keyed outside with Thumbturn inside)</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Omnia Metro Stainless Steel Handleset\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Bore Spacing: 5-1/2\" Center to Center (CTC)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 16-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Diameter: 2-1/6\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omnia Metro Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Handleset",
                "description": "The Omnia Metro Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Handleset has an urban modern feel that will add an industrial chic dimension to your home as your front door lock. The Omnia Metro Front Door Lock features a 1 inch high security stainless steel deadbolt and stainless latch. It fits a standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door prep with 5-1/2 inch Center to Center spacing. This single cylinder handleset is also Panic Proof (turning the inside door lever will unlock the deadbolt for easy quick emergency exits).\r\n",
